# UI change safety (Persona)

Current brand tokens live in `frontend/src/styles/globals.css`:
- Day accent `#002fa7` (Klein blue)
- Night accent `#e11d48` (crimson)

## Never do without an explicit user request that lists paths

- `git restore` / `git checkout HEAD --` on any `frontend/` UI file
- Restoring "original" / "HEAD" / "before redesign" UI wholesale
- Fixing a truncated CSS file by replacing it with `git show HEAD:...`

## If CSS is truncated

Rewrite the missing sections in place (keep current `--accent` tokens). Do not copy the full file from git HEAD.

## After any UI write touching theme/shell

Confirm on disk: day `--accent: #002fa7` still present in `globals.css`. If teal `#1f6b5a` reappears, stop and tell the user — do not silently continue.

## Commits

Persona UI work should be committed soon after acceptance so a restore cannot wipe it back to the old teal theme.
